Package: MSDS457TennisElo
Type: Package
Title: Surface-Adjusted Elo Ratings for Professional Tennis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ryenn", "McAdory", email = "mcadory1119@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides vectorized helpers for the Elo rating system
    applied to professional tennis. Calculates the
    expected win probability between two players and updates both
    players' ratings after a match.
